*** UC SPICE *** , MIN_RESIST 4.0, MIN_CAPAC 0.1FF

*** SUBCIRCUIT ALU_cs__NAND FROM CELL ALU_cs:NAND{sch}
.SUBCKT ALU_cs__NAND A B Y
** GLOBAL gnd
** GLOBAL vdd
Mnmos@0 Y A vdd vdd PMOS L=0.6U W=1.8U
Mnmos@1 Y B vdd vdd PMOS L=0.6U W=1.8U
Mnmos@2 Y A net@8 gnd NMOS L=0.6U W=1.8U
Mnmos@3 net@8 B gnd gnd NMOS L=0.6U W=1.8U
.ENDS ALU_cs__NAND

*** SUBCIRCUIT ALU_cs__XOR FROM CELL ALU_cs:XOR{sch}
.SUBCKT ALU_cs__XOR A B Y
** GLOBAL gnd
** GLOBAL vdd
Mnmos@0 notA_output A vdd vdd PMOS L=0.6U W=1.8U
